<Base title="About" description="Operation In My Backyard is a 501(c)(3) in Kensington, Philadelphia.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>Our mission is to empower individuals who are lacking stable housing and using drugs in Philadelphia through education, outreach and building relationships and trust within the community.</p>
  <p>We believe in building relationships with people where they are. Through education and working together with the people we serve, we are able to refer people to treatment with a real chance of success, whatever that looks like for them.</p>
  <p>We're a charitable tax exempt organization.</p>
  <p>We post from outreach every week on <a href={site.links.instagram}>Instagram</a> and <a href={site.links.facebook}>Facebook</a>. That's the best way to see what we do.</p>
  <p class="standalone"><a href="/friends/">Our friends</a></p>
</Base>
